OL,3,GNEWSATributes to 'much loved' cyclist
OL,4,Akilled in Port Glasgow crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 46-year-old's cycling club
OL,7,FJohnstone Wheelers said it was
OL,8,F"devastated at the loss of one of
OL,9,Fcycling's good guys".
